  "releaseNotes": "Release notes:\n\n* New Random Sources API (RandomSources): reproducible seeded runs with cross-platform parity within a major version, independent streams for parallel code, and state save/restore.\n* Compatibility and interop: SeedProfile (including NumPy for supported generators) and full System.Random bridging.\n* Expanded RNG catalog (Numerics.NET.Random) and library-wide updates to accept random sources while retaining System.Random compatibility.\n\nMore details: https://numerics.net/documentation/release-notes/",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": true,
  "summary": "Numerics.NET - math, statistics, and data analysis libraries for .NET.",
